{"resourceIdentifier":"1332","resourceName":"Reforestation Project in Yingjing County, Sichuan Province","description":"The project is located in Yingjing County, Sichuan Province, China, which is the conjunction zone of Qionglai and Daxiangling Mountain Range. The project is to establish forest on the land previously logged to generate GHG emission reductions and contribute to local sustainable development. The project is jointed implemented by Paocaowan Forestry Farm and Nibashan Forestry Farm. 159.2ha of mingle forest is to be established by direct planting on degraded lands. 3 land areas covering one village of a township and one forest farm in Yingjing County are involved in the project.  The implementation of the project would reduce the GHG emissions for 100,973tCO2e in 30 years, with an average annual GHG emission of 3,365tCO2e. Climate, Community and Biodiversity (CCB) standard has been applied to the project to ensure the integrated benefit of climate, community and biodiversity. The project was registered with CCB standards on March 20 2013.","location":{"latitude":29.748840,"longitude":102.436547},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1332"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Sichuan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"On Hold - see notification letter"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1332"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1332"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3365"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":180}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code"